flowchart TD
    UI[Tauri UI] --> PG[Policy Gateway]
    PG --> AUTH[Authorization Profile]
    PG --> SCHED[Job Scheduler]
    PG --> APPROVAL[Approval Queue]
    SCHED --> ADAPTERS[Safe Tool Adapters]
    ADAPTERS --> EVIDENCE[Evidence Store]
    ADAPTERS --> AUDIT[Hash-Chained Audit Log]
    EVIDENCE --> VERIFIER[AI Verifier]
    VERIFIER --> FINDINGS[Findings]
    FINDINGS --> REPORTER[AI Reporter]
    REPORTER --> REPORT[Markdown/PDF Report]
    PG -. denies/approves .-> AUDIT
